Product Name: Print Cafe
Product Type: Browser-Based Wireless Printing Web Application
Platform: Windows PC + Android/iOS Mobile + Tablet + Other PCs
Primary Use Case: QR scan → File Upload → Print through Host PC Printer

1. Product Overview

Print Cafe ek browser-based printing system hoga jisme kisi bhi mobile, tablet ya computer se QR Code scan karke host computer ke printer par document print kiya ja sakega.

Is system mein ek computer Host PC ke roop mein kaam karega.

