2. Main Objective

System ka main objective hai:

“Kisi bhi device se QR Code scan karke bina driver install kiye host computer ke connected printer par document print karna.”

User ko host PC ke paas jaane ki zarurat nahi hogi.

Example:

Aapke office reception par ek PC aur printer hai.

Reception PC par QR Code displayed hai.

Employee apne mobile se QR scan karega:

Scan → Upload PDF → Select Pages → Landscape/Portrait → Margin → Scaling → Print

Aur document reception ke printer se print ho jayega.

