4. Core Architecture

System ko do major parts mein divide kiya jayega.

A. Host

Host woh computer hoga jiske saath physical printer connected/install hai.

Host responsibilities:

Host session start karna
Fixed QR generate/show karna
Printer detect karna
Printer select karna
Uploaded files receive karna
Print queue manage karna
Print settings process karna
Printer ko print job bhejna
Job status show karna
B. Client

Client woh device hoga jo QR scan karega.

Client responsibilities:

QR scan
Upload page open
File select/upload
Print settings choose
Print request submit
Job status dekhna
5. Important Technical Requirement

Yahan ek important technical point hai.

Normal browser directly host PC ke installed printers ko access/control nahi kar sakta.

For example:

Mobile Browser
       ↓
Web Server
       ↓
Host PC Browser
       ↓
Windows Printer

Browser security ke wajah se webpage directly:

Windows Printer → Print

control nahi kar sakta.

Isliye system mein Host Print Agent / Local Print Service ki zarurat hogi.

Recommended architecture:

                    INTERNET / LAN
                         │
             ┌───────────┴───────────┐
             │                       │
          CLIENT                   HOST
             │                       │
       Mobile/PC Browser       Browser Dashboard
             │                       │
             └───────────┬───────────┘
                         │
                    Web Server
                         │
                  Print Job Queue
                         │
                  Host Print Agent
                         │
                 Windows Print API
                         │
                         🖨️
                      Printer
Host Print Agent

Windows PC par ek lightweight background application/service chalega.

Example:

Print Cafe Agent

Iska kaam:

Local printers detect karna
Web server se print jobs receive karna
File download karna
Print settings apply karna
Windows print spooler ko job dena
Print status server ko bhejna

Isse user ko printer driver manually configure nahi karna padega beyond normal Windows printer installation.

